---
import { site } from '../lib/data';
import { asset } from '../lib/asset';
---

<section class="section story" id="story">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <figure class="split-media reveal">
      <img src={asset('/img/coffee-pour.jpg')} alt="A slow pour over at the Daloy bar" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption class="media-caption">The bar at 07:40, before the room fills.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="split-body">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">03 · The Story</p>
      <h2 class="display reveal">Built by a family that <em>kept the lease.</em></h2>
      <p class="lede reveal">
        Daloy began as a single espresso machine in a former sunduke shop on Rizal
        Avenue. The family who ran it refused three offers for the lease and
        instead spent a year learning to roast.
      </p>
      <p class="body reveal">
        The room is still owned by them. The coffee comes from three small farms in
        the Cordillera, the produce from Palawan farms we can name, and the lechon
        from a supplier whose pigs we have met. Nothing arrives that we cannot
        explain.
      </p>
      <ul class="story-points reveal">
        <li><span>Roasted</span><strong>Weekly, on the island, in a 12kg drum</strong></li>
        <li><span>Produce</span><strong>From 14 named farms in Palawan</strong></li>
        <li><span>Staff</span><strong>18 people, most hired from the neighbourhood</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="body reveal">
        Open {site.hours[0].day.toLowerCase()} {site.hours[0].open}–{site.hours[0].close}, and later
        on weekends. Walk-ins welcome at the bar; tables are held for reservations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
